WEBVTT

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:04.460
﻿What?

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.390
﻿Plavsky particles are leaking
﻿from somewhere?

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.560
﻿What's going on?

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:19.440
﻿The particles are materializing!

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:20.570
﻿It's an emergency!

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.040
﻿Is the alteration effect
﻿going out of control?

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:29.950
Oh no! At this rate,
the arena will collapse!

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.380
﻿Let's evacuate everyone.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:33.190
﻿Help me!

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:38.060
The emergency exit is this way!

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.460
﻿Line up, everyone.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:42.390
Move forward calmly, please!

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:46.300
﻿Ch-Chairman, please stop the Arista!

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.470
﻿I can't, Miss Baker.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.400
﻿It won't stop glowing!

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:54.840
﻿What's going on!?

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:05.080
﻿Space!?

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.330
﻿Sei, what's that huge thing!?

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:22.770
﻿Yuuki, that's...

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.500
﻿Yeah, there's no doubt.

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:29.780
﻿It's Space Fortress A Baoa Qu.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.160
﻿- Iori!
﻿- Reiji!

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.760
- ﻿Kousaka!
- ﻿Aila!

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:46.100
﻿Misaki!

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.800
﻿Mao!

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:50.470
﻿What're you doing?
﻿It's dangerous here.

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:52.470
﻿Hurry up and evacuate!

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:53.510
﻿Yes!

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:54.440
﻿This way!

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:55.980
﻿Hurry!

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:01.880
﻿You guys!?

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:04.950
﻿Prince Reiji, please save me!

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:08.290
﻿I apologize for stealing the Arista
﻿from your treasure room!

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:09.720
﻿I'm sorry!

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.330
﻿You're from Arian!?

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:14.630
﻿Never mind that,
﻿just do something!

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.360
﻿You're a prince, after all!

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:19.830
﻿What a selfish guy...!

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:23.070
﻿Reiji, we've got to run!

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:23.870
﻿No.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:25.910
﻿Nils!?

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:26.740
Caro!

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:31.380
﻿We saw a large Plavsky particle
﻿crystal under the arena,

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:33.750
﻿and it was out of control.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:34.710
﻿What!?

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:38.750
﻿If the particle emission and
﻿the alteration effect continue,

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:42.590
﻿even I can't predict
﻿what kind of disaster will result.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:48.930
﻿Okay, it still works.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.430
﻿Nils, What're you...?

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.570
﻿It's obvious.

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:56.900
﻿Before the worst can happen,
﻿I'll destroy the crystal!

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:00.040
﻿It's dangerous to go in person.

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:03.240
﻿But if I use my Gunpla to break
﻿into the core of the fortress...

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:05.650
﻿Okay! I'm with you, Nils.

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:07.410
﻿Reiji?

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.550
﻿I'm not gonna turn and run.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:12.890
﻿If there's anything I can do,
﻿I'll do it!

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:18.260
﻿Okay. I'll go, too.

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:22.460
﻿If I ran away,
﻿I wouldn't be a man.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:24.430
﻿Kirara, you run.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.100
﻿What?

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:28.000
﻿You must be kidding.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.040
﻿I'm going too!

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:33.410
﻿I was in the best 4 of the tournament.
﻿You need my strength, don't you?

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:37.310
﻿I'll show you what I've got.

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:43.920
﻿You guys are all fools, no doubt.

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.520
﻿Let's do this, everyone!

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:47.820
﻿Yeah!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.330
﻿Star Build Strike!

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.500
﻿Build Gundam Mk-II!

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:03.940
﻿Mr. Beargguy III!

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:06.840
﻿Miss Sazabi!

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.310
﻿Gundam Fenice Rinascita!

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:12.950
﻿Gerbera Tetra!

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.850
﻿Sengoku Astray Gundam!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:18.850
﻿Knight Gundam!

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:22.120
﻿Let's go!

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.960
﻿I beg you! Please!

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:33.230
﻿With the Exia like this...

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.300
﻿Tatsuya!

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.500
﻿Allan!

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.140
﻿It's alright!

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:44.380
﻿But just in case,
﻿please get away from the arena!

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:47.050
﻿Takeshi! Mr. Ral!

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:48.780
﻿What happened?

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:51.150
﻿I can't find Sei and the others.

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:51.990
﻿What!?

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:54.690
﻿Reiji and China, too.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:55.890
﻿N-No...!

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.830
﻿They're still inside!?

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:03.000
﻿We'll break into the fortress
﻿and destroy the large crystal!

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.260
<i>﻿Roger that!</i>

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:05.300
﻿Huh?

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.370
<i>﻿Enemies?</i>

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:15.340
﻿Unmanned machines for
﻿playing against the computer!?

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:23.080
﻿Those are new products we were
﻿going to announce in this tournament!

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:25.320
﻿Gunpla lookalikes?

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:26.550
﻿Are they bootlegs?!

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:31.590
﻿They're coming!

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.290
﻿Leave them to us!

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:56.580
﻿Sorry!

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:44.300
﻿So many of them!

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.470
﻿What!? What!?

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.170
﻿What's going on!?

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:50.400
﻿Reinforcements?

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:52.640
﻿That's...!

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:01.350
﻿Mao!

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:03.050
﻿Sorry I'm late.

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:04.280
﻿The star machine is here,

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:07.920
﻿Crossbone Maoh!

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:29.180
﻿Go in through that hole!

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:31.010
﻿We'll defend the entrance!

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:32.710
- ﻿Okay!
﻿- We're breaking in!

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:02.510
﻿Caroline!

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:03.340
﻿Nils!

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:15.860
﻿Darn. It's endless!

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:21.960
﻿At this rate...!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:22.960
<i>﻿Mao.</i>

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.900
﻿It's too early to give up, Mao!

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:33.740
﻿M-Master!?

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:38.580
﻿That Gouf is...!?

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:41.910
﻿Lieutenant Ral!

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:43.850
﻿Chinan.

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:47.020
﻿- Let's use "it" once again.
- ﻿Okay.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.600
﻿The ultimate mystery of
﻿the Gunpla Shingyo school,

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:09.540
﻿Chinan Kick!

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:28.490
﻿They're absurdly strong.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.060
﻿Awesome.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:34.730
﻿That's the true strength
﻿of the Blue Giant!

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.140
﻿Master, you're too awesome!

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:46.410
﻿The tide has turned.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:01.390
﻿- What!?
- ﻿What's this beam?

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.130
<i>﻿Mr. Sei, what was that!?</i>

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:09.500
﻿N-No way...

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:31.160
﻿Sei, where are we headed?

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.160
﻿To the core of the fortress.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:34.090
﻿Okay!

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:37.560
﻿What?

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:40.670
﻿No!

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.770
<i>﻿A mass of particles!</i>

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.080
﻿Reiji!

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.140
﻿Iori!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.340
﻿- Kousaka!
- ﻿Aila!

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:27.710
﻿Kousaka, can you move?

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:28.310
﻿Sei.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:30.680
﻿Behind you!

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:35.190
﻿Go, Iori!

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:39.060
﻿Destroy the crystal, quick!

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:40.530
﻿Shut up!

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:45.770
﻿Rage on, Exia!

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:49.840
﻿Trans-Am!

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.610
﻿Tatsuya Yuuki!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.580
﻿Leave this part to us.

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:02.350
﻿Us...?

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:03.450
<i>﻿Sei.</i>

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.050
﻿Dad!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.620
<i>﻿Since it fired such
﻿a huge particle beam...</i>

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:14.960
<i>﻿the large crystal must be
﻿behind that gun battery!</i>

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:29.240
﻿- Yuuki!
﻿- Yes, sir!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:33.310
﻿Sei, we'll protect them!

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:36.080
<i>﻿You two, break down the crystal!</i>

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.820
<i>﻿We're counting on you, Reiji!</i>

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.450
<i>﻿Please, Iori!</i>

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.520
<i>﻿Go, Reiji!</i>

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.090
﻿- Sei.
﻿- Let's go!

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:03.280
﻿Wh-What?

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.810
﻿A particle storm?

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:11.080
﻿We can't move forward!

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.050
﻿No!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.460
﻿You and I can do this!

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:21.760
﻿Alright!

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:27.130
﻿RG System, full release!

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:34.470
﻿- Hyper...
- Build...

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:36.610
Knuckle!!!

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:46.550
﻿Go!!!

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:13.410
﻿Yeah!

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:20.490
﻿Sei.

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:21.750
﻿They did it.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:23.020
﻿Iori!

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:23.960
﻿Reiji!

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:25.660
﻿What's this!?

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:27.590
﻿The particles are disappearing.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:31.060
﻿Well done!

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:34.000
﻿Sei and Reiji.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.620
﻿Sei. Reiji.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.390
﻿Takeshi.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:15:01.030
﻿Everyone.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:04.160
Sei.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:05.900
﻿What about the large crystal?

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.670
﻿We destroyed it.

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:09.370
﻿You did it.

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:11.640
﻿But it's a little regrettable, too.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:12.640
﻿Huh?

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:17.040
﻿If the Plavsky particles were
﻿being generated by that crystal,

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.980
﻿then we'll never...

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:21.810
﻿Wh-What!?

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:23.380
﻿H-He's glowing!

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:25.780
﻿Because the Arista is gone,

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:28.550
﻿I'm going back to Arian too?

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:31.860
﻿No!

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:34.730
﻿I was a success in this world!

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:37.360
﻿This can't be happening!!!

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:39.670
﻿Chairman!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.600
﻿Th-They're gone?

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.970
﻿What was that?

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:52.510
﻿Reiji!

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.210
﻿Huh?

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:57.420
﻿Well, let's get to it.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.950
﻿Huh? Get to what?

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:01.990
﻿We made a promise.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.320
﻿Let's fight a great battle.

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:09.630
﻿So that people all over the world
﻿can feel the joys of Gunpla.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.030
﻿Yeah, you're right.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:17.000
﻿Tatsuya Yuuki was being
﻿controlled by that guy Mashita.

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:20.410
﻿That kind of victory
﻿doesn't feel like winning.

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:23.040
﻿You're really gonna fight?

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:25.540
﻿Must you do that now?

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:27.750
﻿The particles are disappearing.

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.720
﻿We may not be able to
﻿play Gunpla Battle ever again.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:33.950
So...

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:35.920
﻿Okay. Let's play.

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.820
﻿Yeah, let's play.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:40.790
﻿But your Gunpla's in no shape to—

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:44.900
﻿Use these.

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:46.570
﻿Please use these.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:51.370
﻿Thank you, Mr. Fellini and Mao.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:57.510
﻿It's the best we can do now.

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:59.510
﻿Thanks, Allan.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:10.690
<i>﻿Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.630
<i>﻿Field 3, Forest.</i>

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:24.440
﻿All the Gunpla fans around the world,

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.070
﻿are you watching this?

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:30.780
﻿If you are,
﻿keep your eyes on this fight!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:32.910
<i>﻿Battle start.</i>

00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:34.950
﻿- Let's go!
- ﻿Yeah!

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:53.270
﻿Thank you, Iori and Reiji.

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:56.140
﻿This is the battle
﻿I've been waiting for!

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:59.070
﻿Yeah. Me, too!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.650
﻿Thank you, Reiji.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:09.480
﻿What for?

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:14.320
﻿If I hadn't teamed up with you,
﻿I couldn't enjoy a battle like this.

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:19.290
﻿I wanted to be like my dad,
﻿but I'm bad at controlling.

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:22.430
﻿You're not bad at all.

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:23.760
﻿Huh?

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:28.600
﻿You like Gunpla so much that you
﻿don't want to damage it in battle.

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:33.510
﻿That's why you couldn't
﻿concentrate on controlling.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:36.410
﻿What you're missing isn't skill,

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:39.750
﻿but the resolve to fight on,
﻿whatever you might lose.

00:18:41.110 --> 00:18:41.980
﻿Yeah.

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:44.950
﻿I've learned that
﻿from so many people.

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.120
﻿Yuuki.

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:49.590
﻿Mr. Fellini. Mao.

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:52.060
﻿Nils. Miss Aila.

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:57.560
﻿And Kousaka taught me
﻿to free my imagination,

00:18:57.560 --> 00:19:00.700
﻿and something more important.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.040
﻿Sei.

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:11.340
﻿If you have all that,
﻿you can move forward, right?

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:12.280
﻿You think?

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:14.250
﻿Just try.

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:20.790
﻿Here I go!

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:30.200
﻿Good, Sei. Good!

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:36.140
﻿Darn!

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:51.080
﻿Gotcha!

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:01.660
﻿The Plavsky particles are...

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.500
﻿Reiji?

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:11.700
﻿Reiji!

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:17.210
﻿Gunpla Battle is really fun.

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:19.580
﻿It's the greatest!

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:22.880
﻿Y-Yeah!

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:29.960
﻿So let's keep playing it together,
﻿next year and the one after...!

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:34.690
﻿Why won't you answer me?

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:37.860
﻿We'll play Gunpla Battle
﻿together forever, right?

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:39.100
﻿Make a wish on that gem!

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.800
﻿Sei.

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:49.910
﻿When I fought with you before,
﻿I thought that...

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:52.740
﻿I want to play Gunpla Battle
﻿against you when you're stronger.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:56.150
﻿That's my wish now.

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:59.080
Reiji﻿...

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:01.990
﻿Become stronger.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:05.920
Y﻿eah.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:13.770
﻿It's a promise.

00:21:15.270 --> 00:21:16.670
﻿Yeah.

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:38.690
﻿It's a promise, Sei.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.570
﻿Reiji.

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:51.500
﻿We'll meet again, Sei.

00:21:52.300 --> 00:21:57.640
﻿Because we'll always
﻿be connected.

00:21:58.780 --> 00:21:59.850
﻿You forgot this.

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:02.980
﻿What!? Why are you here!?

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:07.920
﻿Because I made a wish.

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:09.390
﻿What wish?

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:11.560
﻿Don't you get it!?

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:13.360
﻿You're so slow-witted!

00:22:14.260 --> 00:22:16.730
﻿Why are you so mad?

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:19.000
﻿Re... Re...

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:22.070
﻿You fool, Reiji!

00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:05.080
﻿A year has passed since that day...

00:23:07.110 --> 00:23:09.320
<i>We now begin match seven...</i>

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:12.750
﻿<i>...of the Japanese 3rd Block qualifiers.</i>

00:23:13.670 --> 00:23:17.190
<i>The contestant
is Sei Iori,
